    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Title">启动前命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Desc">在游戏进程启动之前执行的命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Pre.Watermark">例如：taskkill /IM SomeApp.exe</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Title">启动后命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Desc">在游戏进程退出之后执行的命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Post.Watermark">例如：shutdown /s /t 60</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Group.Wrapper">运行包装器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Title">包装器命令</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Desc">使用 %command% 代表原始的游戏启动命令，留空则不使用包装器</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Watermark">例如：gamemoderun %command%</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Title">包装器在 Windows 上不可用</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wrapper.Unsupported.Desc">Windows 的游戏通过 UWP/GDK 包激活启动，没有可供包装的进程命令行。启动前与启动后命令仍然可用。</x:String>
