    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wait.Title">等待启动前命令完成</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Wait.Desc">关闭时启动前命令将在后台执行，游戏立即启动</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Timeout.Title">等待超时时间（秒）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Timeout.Desc">超过该时间后将终止命令并继续启动游戏，0 表示无限等待</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.LaunchCommand.Abort.Title">命令失败时中止启动</x:String>
